  "contract": [
    "Snapshot byte-truncated sector count; zero24-byte header once; for each sector snapshot live base+sector*4096+16, then read up to eight headers with stride24. Reload device/read callback for every record.",
    "Stop the current sector when either word8 or word12 is FFFFFFFF, then continue next sector. No CRC/content validation is implied.",
    "Count accepted headers modulo256; header contents persist across full/partial/failed reads, whose return statuses are ignored as stock.",
    "Delete-all scans, erases all sectors only for a nonzero byte count, then logs captured count. Erase uses a fresh sector-count snapshot.",
    "Reuse existing sleep context, C erase loop, actual EABI clear and upstream memset; no duplicate persistent state."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The scan extent is108 bytes with106 reachable instruction bytes; the two-byte alignment NOP at0x5b34a has no reachable predecessor from the entry. Delete-all covers80 bytes.",
