    "Preserved stock failed-read/stale-header and count-wrap behavior is compatibility evidence, not a reliability guarantee.",
    "Saved integer/FP registers, masks and caller-stack guards checked; private frames, incidental void registers, APSR, concurrency/faults excluded.",
    "Physical NOR reads/erase, power-loss behavior, final source linking and boot remain unverified. Other sleep-storage assembly remains separate work."
